# The dbt job's own dependency set (pipeline/DBT.md's CI plan), compiled to
# requirements-dbt.txt with pip-compile on Python 3.12 - the version that job
# pins deliberately, because dbt tends to lag the newest CPython the pytest
# job runs. Separate from requirements.in on purpose: the pytest job never
# needs dbt, and the dbt job never needs rasterio/pillow/pmtiles.
#
# duckdb is pinned identically to requirements.in's hand-written pin, and for
# the same ABI reason - the spatial extension the profiles.yml loads is
# ABI-locked to the exact DuckDB version. Keep the two pins moving together.
duckdb==1.5.5
